@startuml admin-dashboard
!include admin-common.puml
title Dashboard administrateur

== Dashboard administrateur ==
Admin -> Frontend: Consulter dashboard global
Frontend -> API: GET /api/admin/dashboard
API -> Auth: Vérifier rôle ADMIN
Auth --> API: admin verified

API -> AdminCtrl: getDashboard()
AdminCtrl -> AnalyticsSvc: getGlobalMetrics()

par Métriques utilisateurs
    AnalyticsSvc -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM users WHERE role=USER
    AnalyticsSvc -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM users WHERE created_at >= 'date_param'
    DB --> AnalyticsSvc: user metrics
else Métriques événements
    AnalyticsSvc -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM events WHERE status=published
    AnalyticsSvc -> DB: SELECT SUM(revenue) FROM orders WHERE status=paid
    DB --> AnalyticsSvc: event metrics
else Métriques sécurité
    AnalyticsSvc -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM audit_logs WHERE action LIKE 'security_%'
    AnalyticsSvc -> Redis: GET security:alerts:count
    Redis --> AnalyticsSvc: security alerts
end

AnalyticsSvc -> AnalyticsSvc: Aggregate platform KPIs
AnalyticsSvc --> AdminCtrl: dashboard data
AdminCtrl --> API: global metrics
API --> Frontend: dashboard data
Frontend --> Admin: Dashboard avec métriques globales

@enduml